---
source: crates/agent-compose/tests/cli.rs
expression: stdout(&output)
---
Serve the project's triggers: `http` routes, `schedule` ticks, `kind: command` event sources (validates, builds, then launches the app)

Usage: agent-compose serve [OPTIONS] <PATH>

Arguments:
  <PATH>
          Path to the spec entrypoint (conventionally `main.yml`)

Options:
      --host <HOST>
          The address to listen on
          
          [default: 127.0.0.1]

      --port <PORT>
          The port to listen on; `0` takes one the operating system picks
          
          [default: 0]

      --target <NAME>
          Deploy target to resolve and emit for
          
          [default: local]

      --out <DIR>
          Where to write the generated project [default: <project>/build/<target>]

      --no-build
          Launch the project already built in the output directory as it stands: no validation, no build, and the spec is not read

      --format <FORMAT>
          How to report what was found

          Possible values:
          - human: Written for a person, on stderr
          - json:  One JSON object on stdout
          
          [default: human]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
